CREATE TRIGGER DocumentsDefDelete  ON DocumentsDef FOR DELETE AS DECLARE @MID      INT DECLARE @VSLastId INT SELECT  @MID=DocumentID from Deleted SELECT @VSLastId=LastID from TablesID WHERE TablesID.TableName='DocumentsDef' IF @MID > @VSLastId BEGIN  RETURN END  Insert Operations (OperationID, OperationType, OperationTable)  SELECT Deleted.DocumentID, 'Delete' AS OperationType ,'DocumentsDef' AS OperationTable From Deleted 